														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1884699">
									

<p>That's the beautiful part. It isn't. Or rather, I don't see it as that. The Foundation, in their bid to make sense of a universe that has for a aeons ceased to make sense, throws this in with the Broken God. Because it says it right down there at the bottom, doesn't it?! It has to be part of them! Who else but us, the GoC, the Insurgents, a few dicks(AWCY?) and they themselves know of the Broken God?</p>
<p>But this isn't something built from parts of a scattered God, to be reunited and made whole. It's a Hell made of iron, oil, brass, bone and blood, crafted and carved with human hands. The God-Once-Broken was nowhere near this, no god ever was.</p>

