<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>The facility is constructed primarily from concrete, iron, and brass; but also a number of exotic and/or unknown material</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Semicolons do not work that way; you should look to the oatmeal comic about them.</p>
<blockquote>
