</blockquote>
<p>This is really awkward.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>and hostile entities within<br />
All instances of SCP-1461-1 are considered extremely hostile</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I feel that at some point, we get it. These super-augmented things don't like us.</p>
<blockquote>
