<blockquote>
<p>repeating stream of speech peppered with religious symbolism</p>
</blockquote>
<p>&quot;peppered&quot; is odd tone.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Orb Room (Sub-Level Ten): [DATA EXPUNGED]</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I don't agree with this expungement. I find it sloppy.</p>
